<title>SPAIN: Spanish car sales up 15.57 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Spanish car sales up 15.57 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car sales rose 15.57 percent in July to 119,628 compared with 103,510 in the same month last year, provisional data from the Spanish National Carmakers' Association ANFAC showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The increase in the first seven months of the year was 11.11 percent versus the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Sales of all-terrain vehicles rose 14.86 percent in July to 5,813 units.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
